{
  "_comment": [
    "Cached token (uma oauth2 envelope) corpus. valid: decode succeeds, expires_at_utc is the instant normalised to UTC (RFC 3339, fractional seconds only when non-zero), re-encode equals `doc` (or `encoded`) after normalising expires_at to UTC.",
    "invalid: decode fails naming `field`. schema_gap as in grant-corpus.json."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "valid minimal",
      "valid": true,
      "doc": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "oauth2",
        "access_token": "fake-access-token-1",
        "expires_at": "2030-01-02T03:04:05Z"
      },
      "expires_at_utc": "2030-01-02T03:04:05Z"
    },
